\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Top: the IQ modulator drive signals $s_I(t)$, $s_Q(t)$ (\textit  {generateIqModulatorDrive.m}) at $\beta =$~Optimal~Modulation~Depth, $f_m=\SI {15}{\mega \hertz }$ --- a DC bias and a single RF tone. Bottom: the resulting spectrum, recovered by an FFT over one modulation cycle of the reconstructed envelope $s_I(t)+i\,s_Q(t)$; exactly three lines, no higher orders, unlike Figure~\ref {fig:sideband-regimes}'s EOM spectrum at the same $\beta $.}}{23}{figure.10}\protected@file@percent }
